9,Kaamatan & Sabah’s Austronesian Roots Beyond Borneo | Travelogue - Amazing Borneo Tours,https://www.amazingborneo.com/travel/sabahs-austronesian-heritage-kaamatan-indigenous-culture-and-island-traditions,"May 21, 2026 - From the Kadazan, Dusun, and Rungus communities in Sabah to island societies as far as Polynesia and Madagascar, many cultures across this region share ancient linguistic roots, maritime traditions, ceremonial practices, and community-based ways of life. Today, traces of these shared Austronesian traditions can still be seen throughout Sabah, especially during festivals such as Kaamatan, in indigenous music ...",Rungus,Austronesian
